{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14041","headline":"晚秋东游寄猗氏第五明府解县韩明府 · 耿湋","name":"晚秋东游寄猗氏第五明府解县韩明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"步出青门去，疎钟隔上林。\n四郊多难日，千里独归心。\n暮鸟声偏苦，秋云色易阴。\n乱坟松柏少，野径草茅深。\n灞涘袁安履，汾南宓贱琴。\n何由听白雪，秪益泪沾襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14041.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14041","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}